      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1855 the town was incorporated as Stricklandsville after the nearby Strickland Depot honored early settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://townofmagnolianc.com/about-magnolia/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Chartered the same year, Magnolia quickly became a bustling hub for flower bulb cultivation and shipping.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
