      ],
      "source": "https://townofmagnolianc.com/about-magnolia/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Magnolia Presbyterian Church, standing for generations, remains a cornerstone of the town’s historic character.",
